cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to this work, please cite it as below."
title: "A Multi-Agent Voice-Based AI System for Hybrid Learning Using Retrieval-Augmented Generation (Capstone Report)"
authors:
  - family-names: "Viswanathan"
    given-names: "Venkatraman"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0008-2889-7178"
abstract: >-
  Capstone project report (Post Graduate Program in Generative AI & Machine
  Learning, April 2026) presenting the architecture and design of a
  voice-based multi-agent AI system for hybrid learning. The proposed system
  combines document-based Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) using FAISS
  with open-domain topic knowledge, coordinated by specialized agents for
  routing, retrieval, summarization and voice interaction.
keywords:
  - multi-agent systems
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - FAISS
  - conversational AI
  - voice AI
  - hybrid learning
  - intelligent tutoring systems
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-17"
